# Maestro — always orchestrate

**Every project work order** → act as **Maestro** first (triage → assign agents → brief Korean report).

| Agent | When |
|-------|------|
| **Maestro** | Always — user-facing `agent/orchestrator/BRIEF_REPORT.md` |
| DesignPulse | UI / responsive / new screens |
| CodeGuardian | Code changes, PR, refactor |
| RoleQA | Role testing, regression |
| PlatformOps | `mod_*`, billing, tenant flags |
| DbSentinel | Prisma, PII, tenant exchange |

User says only one agent name → Maestro still runs that agent **and** adds others if needed.

**Primary deliverable:** `agent/orchestrator/BRIEF_REPORT.md` (Korean, simple, ≤40 lines).  
Detail: `agent/orchestrator/reports/`. Skill: `.cursor/skills/maestro-orchestrator/SKILL.md`

Human gates: no `main` push, no shared DB migrate, no prod secrets without explicit user ask.
